  "notes": "### What's New in v1.2.0:\n\n* **Persistent Conversation History**: Slide open the conversation history panel from the header (`☰`) to switch between past screenshots/chats or delete obsolete threads (`🗑️`).\n* **Single-Instance Protection**: Prevents duplicate app processes and global hotkey conflicts. Launching a second instance automatically focuses the running window and exits.\n* **Smooth Streaming Scroll**: Viewport locks to the bottom only if you're looking at the end of the response, permitting free scrolling during live token generation.\n* **Character Boundary Fixes**: Slicing logic now respects Unicode boundaries to prevent app crashes when loading Japanese character snippets.",
